EXACT DECOMPOSITION of Z  (sympy-checkable, no fitting)
       Z  =  sqrt(8pi/3)/kappa  with kappa=1/2  ->  4*sqrt(6)*sqrt(pi)/3  = 5.788810
       Z^2 = 32pi/3 = (1/kappa^2) * (8pi/3) = 4 * (8pi/3)          [exact: 32*pi/3]
       and 8pi/3 = 2 * (4pi/3):   2 = the 1/2 v^2 kinetic factor in the
       Newtonian Friedmann derivation (1/2 Rdot^2 = GM/R),
       4pi/3 = volume of the unit 3-ball, because M = (4pi/3) R^3 rho.
       So Z^2 = 8 * V_unit-3-ball with 8 = 4 (=1/kappa^2) * 2 (kinetic).
       check 32pi/3 == 8*(4pi/3): True
       INDEPENDENT occurrence: a Schwarzschild horizon of radius r_s=2m encloses
       coordinate 3-volume (4pi/3)(2m)^3 = (32pi/3) m^3, hence the textbook mean
       density rho_BH = 3c^6/(32 pi G^3 M^2).  Same integers, 8 = 2^3 from r_s=2m.
       -> a DIFFERENT reason for the same 8; shared ancestor is 'ball volume', not a link.
